# Keeps the build context to source. web/dist and web/node_modules matter for
# more than speed: the Dockerfile runs `npm ci` and then copies web/ over it, so
# a host node_modules would overwrite the freshly installed one — and on an
# arm64 cross-build that means host-arch native binaries in the image.
.git
.github
web/node_modules
web/dist
docs
**/*.md
